sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Dashboard UI
  participant API as Flask API
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant Facade as HomeFacade
  participant Cmd as CommandInvoker
  participant Worker as Simulation Worker
  participant Strategy as Condition Strategy
  participant Audit as CommandAuditRepository

  User->>UI: Toggle device ON
  UI->>API: POST /api/device/{id}/power
  API->>DB: Validate device and read state
  API->>Facade: turn_on_device(id)
  Facade->>Cmd: execute TurnOnCommand
  Cmd-->>Facade: command completed
  API->>DB: Persist state and activity notification
  API->>Audit: Add timestamped command audit record
  API-->>UI: Updated device + dashboard state
  UI-->>User: Refresh device card

  User->>UI: Select Manual mode
  UI->>API: POST /api/mode
  API->>DB: Persist operating_mode=manual
  User->>UI: Simulate door-open trigger
  UI->>API: POST /api/trigger
  API->>DB: Read mode and log event
  Note over API,DB: Manual mode records events but skips automatic rule execution
  User->>UI: Switch room devices ON
  UI->>API: POST /api/rooms/power
  API->>DB: Save device states and undo history
  User->>UI: Undo last command
  UI->>API: POST /api/undo
  API->>DB: Restore previous device power state

  loop Every 10 seconds
    Worker->>DB: Read device state and elapsed ON time
    Worker->>Strategy: Evaluate energy / time / anomaly condition
    Strategy-->>Worker: Condition result
    Worker->>API: Evaluate matching enabled rules
    API->>DB: Persist resulting device state
    API->>Audit: Persist command audit record
  end
